{"question_id":"jaoe38c1lsfjymym","content":"<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R :</p>\n<p><b>Assertion A</b> : Aryl halides cannot be prepared by replacement of hydroxyl group of phenol by halogen atom.</p>\n<p><b>Reason R</b> : Phenols react with halogen acids violently.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> from the options given below :</p>","chapter":"haloalkanes-and-haloarenes","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-29th-january-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift","permalink":"pgiven-below-are-two-statements--one-is-labelled-as-asser-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-idztjcut8xfheh8r","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R :</p>\n<p><b>Assertion A</b> : Aryl halides cannot be prepared by replacement of hydroxyl group of phenol by halogen atom.</p>\n<p><b>Reason R</b> : Phenols react with halogen acids violently.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> from the options given below :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"A is true but R is false"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Both A and R are true but R is NOT the correct explanation of A"},{"identifier":"C","content":"A is false but R is true"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Assertion (A): Given statement is correct because in phenol hydroxyl group cannot be replaced by halogen atom.</p>\n<p>Reason (R) :</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 29th January Morning Shift Chemistry - Haloalkanes and Haloarenes Question 53 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lt2i8yfs/a3b3a91a-c1c8-4e29-ae60-b87749685129/d2a54d80-d468-11ee-9398-959420dc8e1b/file-1lt2i8yft.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Given reason is false.</p>\n<p>Hence Assertion (A) is correct but Reason (R) is false.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0926\u094b \u0915\u0925\u0928 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0939\u0947\u0964 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u094b \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u0925\u0928 A \u0914\u0930 \u0926\u0942\u0938\u0930\u0947 \u0915\u094b \u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923 R \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936\u093e\u092f\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0947:</p>\n<p>\u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u0925\u0928 A : \u0910\u0930\u093f\u0932 \u0939\u0948\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u092b\u0940\u0928\u0949\u0932 \u0915\u0947 \u0939\u093e\u0907\u0921\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0915\u094d\u0938\u093f\u0932 \u0938\u092e\u0942\u0939 \u0915\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0932\u094b\u091c\u0928 \u092a\u0930\u092e\u093e\u0923\u0941 \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u092a\u0928 \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u091c\u093e \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n<p>\u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923 R : \u092b\u093c\u0940\u0928\u0949\u0932 \u0939\u0947\u0932\u094b\u091c\u0928 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\ufffd\ufffd \u0935\u093f\u0938\u094d\u092b\u094b\u091f\u0915 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u092d\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0947\u0964 \u0909\u092a\u0930 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0915\u0925\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0930\u094d\u092d \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0928\u093f\u092e\u094d\u0928\u0932\u093f\u0916\u093f\u0924 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u093f\u090f:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"A \u0938\u0924\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948 \u092a\u0930\u0928\u094d\u0924\u0941 R \u0905\u0938\u0924\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948\u0964\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"A \u0914\u0930 R \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0924\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0914\u0930 R, A \u0915\u0940 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964"},{"identifier":"C","content":"A \u0905\u0938\u0924\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948 \u092a\u0930\